      "raw_text": "space T , the space complexity of the Ω( ) no implemen- end-to-end zero-knowledge Non-interactive - Ligetron is publicly verifiable. Sublinear - in fact, our proof system has shorter proofs Plausibly post-quantum and transparent - Ligetron re- black-box Space-efficient - Ligetron requires space proportional O , S where S is the space re- Lightweight - our end-to-end prover running times are",
